  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Be a champion of wildlife underdogs</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Have you ever heard of the Silvery Pigeon, the Big-headed Turtle or the Black Crested Macaque? Chances are you haven&apos;t, but they are just as threatened as tigers, pandas and elephants. Their populations are plummeting mainly due to illegal and/or unsustainable trade, yet because no one has even heard of them, little is done to prevent them from slipping towards extinction. We focus on these underdogs to stop their declines before they are lost forever.</narrative>
  </description>
